Modifications to upstream components

The prebuilt MROS runtime libraries distributed with this repository
(libmroslib.so, libmroscontrol.so, libmroscostmap2d.so, libmrosgridmap.so,
libmrosurdf.so, libmrostbb.so.2) are modified redistributions of upstream
open-source projects. They were rebuilt with the upstream source
namespaces renamed to a single "mros" namespace, renamed and repackaged as
the MROS runtime, and integrated with the TRON2 controller layout, plugin
descriptor files, and launch environment. A subset of exported symbols was
also renamed.

Upstream projects in this group: eProsima Fast DDS, eProsima Fast CDR,
ros_control, costmap_2d, grid_map, urdfdom, ROS kdl_parser, class_loader,
pluginlib, and Intel Threading Building Blocks.

